What:		/proc/oplus_mem/fragmentation_index
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Android 14 OnePlus 9R proactive-compaction telemetry ABI.
		Reading returns three decimal values: whether node 0 is considered
		fragmented, the huge-page order used for scoring, and the scoring
		proactiveness.  The accepted writes are:

		  compaction_hpage_order=<0..MAX_ORDER-1>
		  compaction_proactiveness=<0..100>

		The interface changes only these scoring values and does not start
		compaction.
